  "title": "Kathy's Award Winning Barbeque Sauce",
  "description": "This is a thick and spicy barbeque chicken recipe that has won several cooking contest. The sauce consists of molasses, brown sugar, tomato juice and spices all pureed together in a blender. Some may wish to cut the amount of pepper in half.",
  "authors": [
